Step 1: README.md Update Kar
Apne project folder mein README.md kholo → saara purana content delete karo → upar wala pura content paste karo → save karo.

Step 2: Git Pe Push Kar
PowerShell mein:

powershell
git add README.md
git commit -m "Add detailed README with architecture and setup guide"
git push origin main
Step 3: GitHub Pe Check Kar
Refresh karo → naya README dikhega with:

✅ All badges

✅ Table of contents

✅ Architecture diagram

✅ Features

✅ Setup steps

✅ API docs

✅ Screenshots section (placeholder — baad mein bhar dega)

